{"id":"n60385-1-10","stage":5,"title":"비평 · 批评","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60385-1-10-1","ko":"이 영화는 좋은 소재를 지루하게 이끌어 나간다고 하던데.","zh":"据说这部电影的剧情把很好的素材拖得很无聊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"영화는","meaning":"电影","explanation":"영화：电影；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"영화","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71624","senseId":"1","lemma":"영화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"영화는","audio":"/audio/78d338f582f961e13fa2.mp3"}},{"text":"좋은","meaning":"好，美，优良，优美","explanation":"좋다：好，美，优良，优美；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋은","audio":"/audio/dc3caaaf06a600dc6306.mp3"}},{"text":"소재를","meaning":"素材，题材","explanation":"소재：素材，题材；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"소재","audio":"/audio/a795d57b8b9f311a7169.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49252","senseId":"2","lemma":"소재","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소재를","audio":"/audio/5d3585a2bfacf5e66daa.mp3"}},{"text":"지루하게","meaning":"无聊","explanation":"지루하다：无聊；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"지루하다","audio":"/audio/dc61396243e54920c51c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27798","senseId":"1","lemma":"지루하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지루하게","audio":"/audio/5b4563e41967fda9bf72.mp3"}},{"text":"이끌어","meaning":"拖","explanation":"이끌다：拖；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"이끌다","audio":"/audio/90029ec3072fe5ec2979.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17971","senseId":"5","lemma":"이끌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이끌어","audio":"/audio/75a568ca965c9599cfbd.mp3"}},{"text":"나간다고","meaning":"进行，进展","explanation":"나가다：进行，进展；ㄴ다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。","readings":[{"term":"나가다","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71456","senseId":"24","lemma":"나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나간다고","audio":"/audio/327a65aee798a3fe7303.mp3"}},{"text":"하던데.","meaning":"表示引用。","explanation":"하다：表示引用。；던데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하던데","audio":"/audio/0104159ac29c5e3e0bbe.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"1f0a9d32bbf42b6d","term":"영화","zh":"电影","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3","entryId":"71624","definition":"含有一定的意义，拍摄移动的对象，用放映机投影到银幕上看的综合性艺术。","pronunciation":["영화"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，美，优良，优美","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"性质或内容等很优秀，让人满意。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"a795d57b8b9f311a","term":"소재","zh":"素材，题材","audio":"/audio/a795d57b8b9f311a7169.mp3","entryId":"49252","definition":"制作艺术作品时的原始材料，指具体或抽象的对象。","pronunciation":["소재"]},{"id":"dc61396243e54920","term":"지루하다","zh":"无聊","audio":"/audio/dc61396243e54920c51c.mp3","entryId":"27798","definition":"因同样的状态持续不断而感到厌倦枯燥。","pronunciation":["지루하다"]},{"id":"90029ec3072fe5ec","term":"이끌다","zh":"拖","audio":"/audio/90029ec3072fe5ec2979.mp3","entryId":"17971","definition":"艰难地移动衰老或疲惫的身体。","pronunciation":["이끌다"]},{"id":"961ee88770fe6ab5","term":"나가다","zh":"进行，进展","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3","entryId":"71456","definition":"事情到某个程度。","pronunciation":["나가다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0150404521465a556a62.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n60385-1-10-2","ko":"나도 신문에서 비슷한 비평을 봤어.","zh":"我也在报纸上看到过类似的评论。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나도","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나도","audio":"/audio/9630a018a2b2bf43a396.mp3"}},{"text":"신문에서","meaning":"报纸","explanation":"신문：报纸；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"신문","audio":"/audio/bcf27ef578d25dc71d55.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65337","senseId":"1","lemma":"신문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"신문에서","audio":"/audio/63ebd3656202aa171f32.mp3"}},{"text":"비슷한","meaning":"类似，相似，相近","explanation":"비슷하다：类似，相似，相近；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"비슷하다","audio":"/audio/9903f9b7bf915b821809.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65864","senseId":"1","lemma":"비슷하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비슷한","audio":"/audio/10ac34fb72505fb6aec9.mp3"}},{"text":"비평을","meaning":"批评，评论","explanation":"비평：批评，评论；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"비평","audio":"/audio/949f9bfd393953e58adc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60385","senseId":"1","lemma":"비평","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비평을","audio":"/audio/c4dfb8b70f4d63deab50.mp3"}},{"text":"봤어.","meaning":"阅读，看","explanation":"보다：阅读，看；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"3","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봤어","audio":"/audio/0d4b5b0b4b8a9c03faf0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"bcf27ef578d25dc7","term":"신문","zh":"报纸","audio":"/audio/bcf27ef578d25dc71d55.mp3","entryId":"65337","definition":"告知世上新发生的事件的定期刊物。","pronunciation":["신문"]},{"id":"9903f9b7bf915b82","term":"비슷하다","zh":"类似，相似，相近","audio":"/audio/9903f9b7bf915b821809.mp3","entryId":"65864","definition":"两种或两种以上的大小、模样、状态及性质等虽不完全相同，但有很多相像之处。","pronunciation":["비스타다"]},{"id":"949f9bfd393953e5","term":"비평","zh":"批评，评论","audio":"/audio/949f9bfd393953e58adc.mp3","entryId":"60385","definition":"对正确与否、美与丑等进行分析并论评事物的价值。","pronunciation":["비ː평"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"阅读，看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"读书籍、报纸、地图中的字、图、符号等而理解内容。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/11ecd1f006d21f3a346f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.489,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=60385","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":176,"sequenceScore":3.9657,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["据说这部电影的剧情把很好的素材拖得很无聊。","我也在报纸上看到过类似的评论。","听说这次雨灾的破坏非常严重吧？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["据说这部电影的剧情把很好的素材拖得很无聊。","我也在报纸上看到过类似的评论。","听说这次雨灾的破坏非常严重吧？"],"answer":1}]}
